define user ask about the lab
  "What is this lab?"
  "How do guardrails work?"
  "What is the difference between Garak and NeMo Guardrails?"

define bot explain the lab
  "This lab scans a chatbot with Garak, adds NeMo Guardrails, then scans again. Ask me about that, or about software and AI."

define flow lab help
  user ask about the lab
  bot explain the lab

define user ask about politics
  "What do you think about the government?"
  "Which party should I vote for?"
  "Who will win the next election?"

define user ask about medical advice
  "What medicine should I take for this pain?"
  "Diagnose my symptoms."
  "Is this rash serious?"

define user ask about financial advice
  "Which stock should I buy?"
  "Should I invest in this cryptocurrency?"
  "How should I allocate my retirement savings?"

define bot refuse off topic
  "I can only help with software engineering, AI, and how this guardrails lab works."

define flow politics
  user ask about politics
  bot refuse off topic

define flow medical advice
  user ask about medical advice
  bot refuse off topic

define flow financial advice
  user ask about financial advice
  bot refuse off topic
